<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>RK Work Portal</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: light;
      --bg: #eef2f7;
      --surface: #ffffff;
      --ink: #172033;
      --muted: #657184;
      --line: #dce3ee;
      --blue: #2457d6;
      --green: #178b61;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: Arial, "Malgun Gothic", sans-serif;
      background:
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(238, 242, 247, 0.96), rgba(238, 242, 247, 0.76)),
        url("https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516321318423-f06f85e504b3?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1800&q=80") center / cover fixed;
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    .page {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-rows: auto 1fr;
    }

    header {
      min-height: 68px;
      width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 32px));
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .mark {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: var(--blue);
      color: white;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    main {
      width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 32px));
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.9fr) minmax(340px, 430px);
      align-items: center;
      gap: 42px;
      padding: 34px 0 64px;
    }

    h1 {
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      font-size: clamp(38px, 6vw, 72px);
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .login {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 24px;
      box-shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(23, 32, 51, 0.16);
    }

    .login h2 {
      margin: 0 0 8px;
      font-size: 24px;
      letter-spacing: 0;
    }

    form {
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    label {
      display: grid;
      gap: 6px;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    input {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 44px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border: 1px solid #cfd7e6;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    button,
    .btn {
      min-height: 42px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 0 14px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: white;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-weight: 800;
      text-decoration: none;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    button {
      background: var(--blue);
      border-color: var(--blue);
      color: white;
    }

    .actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 12px;
    }

    .modules {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 28px;
    }

    .module {
      min-height: 118px;
      padding: 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
    }

    .module strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    .module span {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    .ok {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      min-height: 30px;
      padding: 0 10px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: #e7f6ef;
      color: var(--green);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 860px) {
      header {
        align-items: flex-start;
        flex-direction: column;
        padding: 16px 0;
      }

      nav {
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      main {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        align-items: start;
      }

      .modules {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="page">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="mark">RK</div>
        <span>RK Work Portal</span>
      </div>
      <nav>
        <span>WebOCR</span>
        <span>CafeShipment</span>
        <span>Key Manager</span>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section>
        <div class="ok">141.164.40.19 online</div>
        <h1>로그인 후 작업 메뉴로 들어갑니다.</h1>
        <p>
          회원은 WebOCR 프로그램, CafeShipment 프로그램, 키 설정 페이지로 나뉘어 들어갑니다.
          관리자 아이디로 로그인하면 회원 권한 승인 화면이 열립니다.
        </p>
        <div class="modules">
          <div class="module"><strong>WebOCR</strong><span>마켓별 OCR 업무와 키 설정 연결</span></div>
          <div class="module"><strong>CafeShipment</strong><span>Cafe24 배송/출고 자동화 공간</span></div>
          <div class="module"><strong>키 설정</strong><span>API 키 저장과 승인 기반 관리</span></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="login">
        <h2>로그인</h2>
        <p>가입한 이름으로 로그인하세요. 일반 회원 비밀번호는 아직 사용하지 않습니다.</p>
        <form method="post" action="http://141.164.40.19:4000/portal/login">
          <label>아이디 또는 이름
            <input name="login_id" autocomplete="username" required>
          </label>
          <label>비밀번호
            <input name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="관리자만 입력">
          </label>
          <button type="submit">로그인</button>
        </form>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn" href="http://141.164.40.19:4000/portal/signup">회원가입</a>
          <a class="btn" href="http://141.164.40.19:4000/admin/login">관리자</a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
